00:06:28.900 --> 00:06:30.920
I feel this is a great birthday kickoff.
我觉得这是一个很棒的生日开场。

175
00:06:31.100 --> 00:06:32.680
Well, you deserve to be celebrated.
嗯，你值得被庆祝。

176
00:06:32.680 --> 00:06:34.060
And we love you.
而且我们爱你。

177
00:06:34.200 --> 00:06:34.900
Well, thank you.
好吧，谢谢。

178
00:06:35.380 --> 00:06:38.760
OK, so let's get to all about Pam Beasley.
好了，那我们开始帕姆·比斯利特辑吧。

179
00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:43.460
I thought I would kick off today's episode with this request from Mel E.
我想用德克萨斯州里士满的梅尔·E发来的这个请求来开启今天的节目。

180
00:06:43.700 --> 00:06:44.740
in Richmond, Texas.
梅尔写信说，请读一下帕姆的剧集设定集条目。

181
00:06:45.380 --> 00:06:49.180
Mel wrote in and said, please read the show Bible entry for Pam.
大家猜怎么着？

182
00:06:49.180 --> 00:06:50.820
And guess what, everyone?
珍娜把剧集设定集发给我了。

183
00:06:51.000 --> 00:06:52.340
Jenna sent me the show Bible.
没错。

184
00:06:52.840 --> 00:06:53.760
I did.
我们能借此机会让我快速解释一下吗？

185
00:06:54.200 --> 00:06:58.940
And can we take this opportunity really quickly for me to explain?
好的。

186
00:06:59.720 --> 00:07:00.120
Yes.
我担心我可能误传了剧集设定集的意思。

187
00:07:00.320 --> 00:07:04.020
So I worry that maybe I have misrepresented the show Bible.
或者说我可能误传了，因为我以前从未真正见过它。

188
00:07:04.200 --> 00:07:06.660
Or maybe I have because I had never really seen it.
所以剧集设定集其实就是一份关于每个角色在已播出剧集中所揭示的事实的列表。

189
00:07:06.660 --> 00:07:15.860
So the show Bible is simply a list of facts about each character as they are revealed in an episode that has aired.
因此，剧集设定集中永远不会出现剧集里没有的内容。

190
00:07:16.060 --> 00:07:20.400
So there will never be anything in the show Bible that wasn't also on the show.
那是真的。

191
00:07:20.600 --> 00:07:21.120
That's true.
它就是正史中存在的内容。

192
00:07:21.120 --> 00:07:22.420
It's what exists in the canon.
没错。

193
00:07:22.680 --> 00:07:23.040
Yes.
但我不得不说，看到所有内容罗列出来真的很有趣。

194
00:07:23.360 --> 00:07:26.240
But I have to say, it's really fun to see it all listed out.
因为你会忘记一些事情。

195
00:07:26.380 --> 00:07:27.520
Because you forget things.
完全会。

196
00:07:27.880 --> 00:07:28.280
Completely.
这太有帮助了。

197
00:07:28.600 --> 00:07:29.500
It's so helpful.
而且，珍娜，当你为凯文·马龙和迈克尔·斯科特制作剧集设定集时，你把信息分成了不同的类别。

198
00:07:30.320 --> 00:07:37.220
And, you know, Jenna, when you did show Bibles for Kevin Malone and Michael Scott, you sort of grouped the information in different pairings.
是的。

199
00:07:37.460 --> 00:07:37.860
Yes.
我也做了同样的事情，但是，你知道，我们的大脑运作方式不同。

200
00:07:37.860 --> 00:07:40.980
I did the same thing, but, you know, our brains work differently.
没错。

201
00:07:41.180 --> 00:07:45.160
So here's the way I'm going to share the show Bible info for Pam Beasley.
这就是我分享帕姆·比斯利剧集设定集信息的方式。

202
00:07:45.520 --> 00:07:49.480
Pam's full name is Pamela Morgan Halpert, formerly Beasley.
帕姆的全名是帕梅拉·摩根·哈珀特，原姓比斯利。

203
00:07:49.760 --> 00:07:51.340
She is Presbyterian.
她是长老会教徒。

204
00:07:51.760 --> 00:07:55.640
Her address is 383 Linden Avenue in Scranton, Pennsylvania.
她的住址是宾夕法尼亚州斯克兰顿市林登大道383号。

205
00:07:56.000 --> 00:07:58.840
She drives a silver Subaru Outback.
她开一辆银色的斯巴鲁傲虎。

206
00:07:59.080 --> 00:08:02.700
She is a slow driver, but she can drive a stick shift.
她开车很慢，但她会开手动挡。

207
00:08:03.380 --> 00:08:03.900
Oh, yeah.
哦，没错。

208
00:08:04.080 --> 00:08:05.100
See, I forgot that.
你看，我把这茬忘了。

209
00:08:05.580 --> 00:08:08.400
She needs glasses, but usually wears contacts.
她需要戴眼镜，但通常戴隐形眼镜。

210
00:08:08.880 --> 00:08:12.620
Her instant messenger name is Receptionitis15.
她的即时通讯账号是Receptionitis15。

211
00:08:13.520 --> 00:08:22.460
Her job titles at Dunder Mifflin were listed as receptionist, sales rep, and secret assistant to their regional manager by Dwight.
她在邓德·米夫林的职位记录为前台、销售代表，以及德怀特所说的区域经理的秘密助理。

212
00:08:22.720 --> 00:08:28.180
We know she goes on to become the office administrator, but that is not covered in the show Bible because it stops.
我们知道她后来成了办公室行政主管，但这在剧集设定集里没写，因为设定集到那儿就截止了。

213
00:08:28.500 --> 00:08:28.740
Yep.
是啊。

214
00:08:28.900 --> 00:08:30.740
It stops after season six?
是在第六季之后截止的吗？

215
00:08:30.940 --> 00:08:31.540
Yeah.
对。

216
00:08:31.660 --> 00:08:32.060
I think so.
我想是吧。

217
00:08:32.320 --> 00:08:32.620
Around there, yeah.
差不多就在那儿，没错。

218
00:08:32.700 --> 00:08:34.480
But I love this little piece of trivia.
但我很喜欢这个小花絮。

219
00:08:34.760 --> 00:08:36.600
She worked at Dunder Mifflin before Jim.
她在吉姆之前就在邓德·米夫林工作了。

220
00:08:37.020 --> 00:08:37.540
See?
你看？

221
00:08:37.780 --> 00:08:38.620
Oh, my gosh.
天哪。

222
00:08:38.760 --> 00:08:41.060
This is always a hotly debated topic.
这一直是个争论不休的话题。

223
00:08:41.340 --> 00:08:42.820
Who worked there first?
到底谁先在那儿工作的？

224
00:08:43.020 --> 00:08:44.500
It's in Pam's show Bible.
帕姆的剧集设定集里写着呢。

225
00:08:44.720 --> 00:08:44.960
Okay.
好吧。

226
00:08:45.620 --> 00:08:49.980
Then I did a segment called her skills and her, quote, needs improvement liSt.
然后我做了一个环节，叫她的技能和“需要改进”清单。

227
00:08:50.160 --> 00:08:50.420
Oh.
哦。

228
00:08:50.800 --> 00:08:51.720
Her skills.
她的技能。

229
00:08:51.960 --> 00:08:58.180
She types 90 words a minute, is able to change a tire by herself, and is an accomplished volleyball player.
她每分钟能打90个字，能自己换轮胎，还是个出色的排球运动员。

230
00:08:58.900 --> 00:09:06.180
Her needs improvement list, she has the lowest sales record in the office, and the worst attitude.
她的“需要改进”清单上写着，她是办公室里销售业绩最差的，而且态度最差。

231
00:09:06.180 --> 00:09:07.720
The worst attitude?
态度最差？

232
00:09:07.720 --> 00:09:09.140
Is that in the show Bible?
剧集设定集里真这么写？

233
00:09:09.140 --> 00:09:09.740
It is.
是的。

234
00:09:09.880 --> 00:09:11.820
I did a direct copy and paste.
我是直接复制粘贴过来的。

235
00:09:11.820 --> 00:09:12.300
What?
什么？

236
00:09:12.860 --> 00:09:13.320
What?
什么？

237
00:09:13.320 --> 00:09:13.800
About sales.
关于销售方面。

238
00:09:13.800 --> 00:09:16.100
I guess she has the worst attitude about sales.
我猜她是对销售工作的态度最差。

239
00:09:16.280 --> 00:09:16.500
Oh.
哦。

240
00:09:16.500 --> 00:09:18.400
Oh, I don't even think that's true.
哦，我觉得这甚至都不是真的。

241
00:09:19.120 --> 00:09:19.620
Okay.
好吧。

242
00:09:19.620 --> 00:09:25.180
Next on her needs improvement list, her attempt at a Southern accent sounds like Forrest Gump.
她“需要改进”清单上的下一条，她模仿的南方口音听起来像阿甘。

243
00:09:25.520 --> 00:09:26.380
Oh, okay.
哦，好吧。

244
00:09:27.120 --> 00:09:30.260
She has won the following awards at the Dundies.
她在邓迪奖上获得过以下奖项。

245
00:09:30.540 --> 00:09:32.640
Longest engagement and widest sneakers.
最长订婚奖和最宽运动鞋奖。

246
00:09:33.100 --> 00:09:34.820
Here are some of her likes.
以下是她的一些喜好。

247
00:09:35.100 --> 00:09:41.240
Asian food, free sale, sudoku, a house with a terrace upstairs to plant flowers on.
亚洲美食、特卖会、数独、带楼上露台可以种花的房子。

248
00:09:41.640 --> 00:09:44.140
She loves to draw to watch HGTV.
她喜欢画画，喜欢看HGTV频道。

249
00:09:44.460 --> 00:09:46.180
She likes dogs over cats.
比起猫，她更喜欢狗。

250
00:09:46.180 --> 00:09:53.300
She loves a sprinkle of cinnamon on her coffee, mixed berry yogurt, French onion chips, making copies.
她喜欢在咖啡里撒一点肉桂粉、混合浆果酸奶、法式洋葱薯片，还有复印文件。

251
00:09:54.080 --> 00:09:55.580
That cracks me up.
那可真是笑死我了。

252
00:09:55.920 --> 00:10:04.080
And she likes the following movies, Fargo, Edward Scissorhands, Dazed and Confused, Breakfast Club, The Princess Bride, and Legally Blonde.
她喜欢的电影有：《冰血暴》、《剪刀手爱德华》、《年少轻狂》、《早餐俱乐部》、《公主新娘》以及《律政俏佳人》。

253
00:10:04.700 --> 00:10:04.880
Yeah.
没错。

254
00:10:05.340 --> 00:10:06.840
Here are some of her dislikes.
以下是她不喜欢的一些东西。

255
00:10:07.140 --> 00:10:08.120
The Dundies.
邓迪奖。

256
00:10:08.520 --> 00:10:10.740
She considers it like a train wreck.
她觉得那简直是一场灾难。

257
00:10:11.380 --> 00:10:12.000
Direct quote.
原话引用。

258
00:10:12.560 --> 00:10:15.000
She doesn't like frisbee-based competition.
她不喜欢飞盘比赛。

259
00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:17.340
Don't get your frizz on with Pam.
别在帕姆面前玩飞盘。

260
00:10:18.500 --> 00:10:30.120
She does not like hunting, ads for Six Flags with the Creepy Old Guy Dancing, Pig Latin, Country Music, Macanudo's Cigars, and she doesn't like to be called Pammy.
她不喜欢打猎、六旗乐园那个跳舞怪老头的广告、猪拉丁语、乡村音乐、马卡努多雪茄，而且她不喜欢别人叫她帕米。

261
00:10:30.340 --> 00:10:31.460
She does not.
确实不喜欢。

262
00:10:32.060 --> 00:10:33.560
Don't call me Pammy.
别叫我帕米。

263
00:10:33.860 --> 00:10:38.700
Now I have a section I called, She is Prone to Shenanigans and Pranks.
现在我有一个板块，我称之为“她喜欢搞恶作剧和恶搞”。

264
00:10:38.940 --> 00:10:39.240
Oh.
噢。

265
00:10:39.240 --> 00:10:40.940
So, particularly with Jim.
尤其是针对德怀特。

266
00:10:41.300 --> 00:10:42.620
Here are just a few.
这里只列举几个。

267
00:10:43.120 --> 00:10:46.140
She wrote graffiti about Michael on the bathroom wall.
她在洗手间墙上写过关于迈克尔的涂鸦。

268
00:10:46.360 --> 00:10:50.080
She tries to throw stuff in Dwight's coffee mug when he's away.
德怀特不在时，她会往他的咖啡杯里扔东西。

269
00:10:50.400 --> 00:10:50.900
Oh, yeah.
噢，没错。

270
00:10:51.280 --> 00:10:53.560
Like paper clips or messages for Dwight.
比如回形针或者给德怀特的纸条。

271
00:10:53.720 --> 00:10:54.760
I forgot about that.
我都忘了这事了。

272
00:10:54.760 --> 00:10:58.600
And with Jim, she posted Dwight's resume on job sites.
还有，她和吉姆一起把德怀特的简历发到了招聘网站上。

273
00:10:58.950 --> 00:11:06.220
She would sometimes hum the same high-pitched note with Jim to get Dwight to make an appointment with an ear doctor.
她有时会和吉姆一起哼出同样的尖锐音调，好让德怀特去预约耳科医生。

274
00:11:06.420 --> 00:11:07.420
That was very funny.
那太好笑了。

275
00:11:07.780 --> 00:11:13.420
She has been sending Dwight letters from the CIA saying they are considering him for a secret mission.
她一直以中情局的名义给德怀特寄信，说正在考虑让他执行秘密任务。

276
00:11:13.420 --> 00:11:19.240
And she also posed as the Dunder Mifflin Infinity computer system with Jim to prank Dwight.
她还和吉姆假扮成邓德·米夫林无限公司电脑系统来捉弄德怀特。

277
00:11:20.640 --> 00:11:22.160
Next up, relationships.
接下来是人际关系。

278
00:11:22.640 --> 00:11:23.080
Oh.
噢。

279
00:11:23.840 --> 00:11:26.020
She would do Oscar or Toby.
她会选奥斯卡或者托比。

280
00:11:26.860 --> 00:11:31.320
She was engaged to Roy for three years, and she considers Jim her soulmate.
她曾与罗伊订婚三年，而她视吉姆为灵魂伴侣。

281
00:11:32.020 --> 00:11:32.940
Yes, true.
是的，没错。

282
00:11:33.340 --> 00:11:36.040
And one final thing before we go to break.
在进入休息时间前，还有最后一件事。

283
00:11:36.480 --> 00:11:40.300
People often ask us where our characters are now and what they're doing.
人们经常问我们角色现在的去向和近况。

284
00:11:40.560 --> 00:11:43.680
And this is what the NBC website says about Pam.
这是NBC网站上关于帕姆的介绍。

285
00:11:43.680 --> 00:11:49.860
Oh, Pam merged her mural business with a local art gallery in Austin.
噢，帕姆把她的壁画生意和奥斯汀的一家当地画廊合并了。

286
00:11:50.520 --> 00:11:53.660
Currently, she's on an artist retreat in New Mexico.
目前，她正在新墨西哥州参加一个艺术家静修活动。

287
00:11:54.180 --> 00:11:56.840
Oh, I wonder when this was.
噢，我在想这是什么时候的事。

288
00:11:57.040 --> 00:11:58.960
Was this after the finale or something?
这是在大结局之后还是什么的吗？

289
00:11:59.160 --> 00:12:00.740
Must be because you're living in Austin.
肯定是，因为你现在住在奥斯汀。

290
00:12:01.140 --> 00:12:01.400
Yeah.
没错。

291
00:12:01.780 --> 00:12:03.400
Well, there you go.
好吧，就是这样。

292
00:12:03.720 --> 00:12:09.140
That is my show Bible breakdown plus a little extra on all about Pam Beasley.
这就是我的剧集圣经分析，外加一点关于帕姆·比斯利的额外内容。

293
00:12:09.760 --> 00:12:10.960
I loved it.
我太喜欢了。

294
00:12:10.960 --> 00:12:15.020
Do you ever think, like, what if you had, like, a show Bible for your life?
你有没有想过，如果你的生活也有一本“剧集圣经”会怎样？

295
00:12:15.040 --> 00:12:16.540
What would the entries be?
里面会写些什么呢？

296
00:12:16.700 --> 00:12:18.160
How cool that would be?
那该多酷啊？

297
00:12:18.940 --> 00:12:20.100
Is that, you know what?
你知道吗？

298
00:12:20.160 --> 00:12:24.900
That makes me think of those journals that are, like, one line a day journals, where you're
这让我想起了那种“每日一行”的日记本，就是那种让你

299
00:12:24.900 --> 00:12:27.020
supposed to just write one line a day.
每天只写一行字的日记。

300
00:12:27.720 --> 00:12:32.740
I always start those, and I get about 15 days in, and then I forget to do it.
我总是会开始写，但写到15天左右，就忘了继续写了。

301
00:12:33.220 --> 00:12:33.500
Yeah.
是啊。

302
00:12:33.680 --> 00:12:35.480
I had one when Isabel was a toddler.
伊莎贝尔还是幼儿的时候我有一个。

303
00:12:35.820 --> 00:12:39.640
It says something like, kids say the darndest things, and you're supposed to write something
上面写着类似“孩子说的话最妙”之类的，让你每周记下一句

304
00:12:39.640 --> 00:12:46.720
they say each week, and I wrote a bunch in it, and I go back, and it's so sweet and cute
他们说的话，我写了很多在里面，现在回头看，真是又甜又可爱，

305
00:12:46.720 --> 00:12:51.100
and hilarious and such a snapshot of my life with her back then.
又好笑，简直是我当时和她生活的一个缩影。

306
00:12:51.260 --> 00:12:51.520
Yeah.
是啊。

307
00:12:52.120 --> 00:12:52.380
Aw.
噢。

308
00:12:52.560 --> 00:12:53.020
I know.
我知道。

309
00:12:53.280 --> 00:12:54.660
Well, lady, thank you.
好吧，女士，谢谢你。

310
00:12:54.960 --> 00:12:56.280
Why don't we go to break?
我们要不要先休息一下？

311
00:12:56.420 --> 00:12:59.920
And when we come back, we'll keep talking all about Pam Beasley.
回来之后，我们会继续聊聊帕姆·比斯利。

312
00:12:59.920 --> 00:13:05.680
I'm not going to lie, everyone, this is triggering my social anxiety a little bit.
说实话，各位，这让我有点社交焦虑了。

313
00:13:05.820 --> 00:13:05.920
Why?
为什么？

314
00:13:05.920 --> 00:13:07.420
This is like, it's such a spotlight.
这感觉就像，聚光灯全打在我身上。

315
00:13:07.460 --> 00:13:14.860
It's like my birthday, and it's all about Pam Beasley, and I'm feeling a little shy about
就像我的生日一样，全都是关于帕姆·比斯利的，我对此感到有点害羞，

316
00:13:14.860 --> 00:13:16.560
it all, but let's do it.
但我们开始吧。

317
00:13:16.700 --> 00:13:17.800
Well, here's the thing.
好吧，是这样的。

318
00:13:17.800 --> 00:13:19.560
We're going to have some mixed berry yogurt.
我们要吃点混合浆果酸奶。

319
00:13:19.800 --> 00:13:20.880
That's going to make you feel good.
那会让你感觉好些的。

320
00:13:21.020 --> 00:13:22.940
And then we're going to talk about Pam.
然后我们要聊聊帕姆。

321
00:13:23.240 --> 00:13:23.660
Not you.
不是你。

322
00:13:23.820 --> 00:13:25.080
We're going to talk about Pam.
我们要聊的是帕姆。

323
00:13:25.740 --> 00:13:26.060
All right.
好吧。

324
00:13:26.060 --> 00:13:27.740
Someday you're going to talk about Angela Martin.
总有一天你们会聊到安吉拉·马丁的。

325
00:13:27.920 --> 00:13:29.020
I am not going to take it personal.
我不会往心里去的。

326
00:13:31.480 --> 00:13:34.240
When you all call her a bitch, I won't take it personal.
当你们都叫她婊子时，我不会往心里去的。

