00:32:40.740 --> 00:32:46.640
went up to get her snacks, my snack of choice is Diet Coke and Junior Mints.
去买零食时，我首选的零食是健怡可乐和朱尼尔薄荷糖。

761
00:32:46.840 --> 00:32:47.740
Is it really?
真的吗？

762
00:32:48.020 --> 00:32:48.480
I did not know that.
我以前都不知道。

763
00:32:48.480 --> 00:32:50.140
That's what I would always get at the movies.
那是我看电影时总会买的东西。

764
00:32:51.220 --> 00:32:54.580
Pam ordered a Diet 7-Up and popcorn.
帕姆点了一杯健怡七喜和爆米花。

765
00:32:55.580 --> 00:32:56.380
How come?
为什么？

766
00:32:56.760 --> 00:32:57.160
Don't know.
不知道。

767
00:32:57.340 --> 00:32:59.020
She loves Diet 7-Up, apparently.
显然她很爱喝健怡七喜。

768
00:32:59.320 --> 00:33:02.300
So I did this exercise before I even auditioned for Pam.
所以我在试镜帕姆这个角色之前就做了这个练习。

769
00:33:02.440 --> 00:33:05.160
And when I went to my audition, I drank a Diet 7-Up.
当我去参加试镜时，我喝了一杯健怡七喜。

770
00:33:05.340 --> 00:33:07.100
This is so wild to me.
这对我来说太不可思议了。

771
00:33:07.220 --> 00:33:08.280
I did not know this.
我竟然不知道这件事。

772
00:33:08.460 --> 00:33:12.920
All these years I've known you and I did not know that you made the choice that Pam drinks
认识你这么多年，我居然不知道你为帕姆做出的设定是她喝

773
00:33:12.920 --> 00:33:13.740
Diet 7-Up.
健怡七喜。

774
00:33:13.860 --> 00:33:14.420
Yeah, she does.
没错，她是喝这个。

775
00:33:14.600 --> 00:33:15.500
She loves it.
她很爱喝。

776
00:33:15.800 --> 00:33:16.200
Wow.
哇。

777
00:33:16.380 --> 00:33:16.640
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

778
00:33:16.980 --> 00:33:17.280
Okay.
好吧。

779
00:33:18.080 --> 00:33:18.520
All right.
行吧。

780
00:33:18.600 --> 00:33:19.900
Here's the other thing I'm going to share.
我还要分享另一件事。

781
00:33:19.900 --> 00:33:21.300
This is my other actor prep.
这是我做的另一项演员准备工作。

782
00:33:21.860 --> 00:33:27.880
When I am working on a character, a lot of times I will create a song liSt.
当我在塑造角色时，我经常会创建一个歌单。

783
00:33:28.120 --> 00:33:30.500
We all know I made Sounds of Scranton.
我们都知道我制作过《斯克兰顿之声》。

784
00:33:30.720 --> 00:33:30.880
Yeah.
是的。

785
00:33:30.880 --> 00:33:32.220
That was when we were doing the pilot.
那是在我们拍摄试播集的时候。

786
00:33:32.860 --> 00:33:37.380
Well, in between season two and three, I made Pam songs.
而在第二季和第三季之间，我制作了“帕姆之歌”。

787
00:33:37.720 --> 00:33:40.140
That's what I called my playlist, Pam songs.
我把我的播放列表命名为“帕姆之歌”。

788
00:33:40.700 --> 00:33:42.520
Please tell me you're going to share your Pam songs.
请告诉我你愿意分享你的“帕姆之歌”。

789
00:33:42.680 --> 00:33:44.140
I'm going to share my Pam songs.
我打算分享我的“帕姆之歌”。

790
00:33:44.140 --> 00:33:50.440
So on my Instagram lately, I've been sharing guitar riffs because I'm working on a song
最近我在Instagram上分享了一些吉他即兴演奏，因为我正在为我将在李的电影中扮演的角色

791
00:33:50.440 --> 00:33:52.880
list for the character that I'm going to play in Lee's movie.
制作一个歌单。

792
00:33:53.100 --> 00:33:53.340
Right.
对。

793
00:33:53.500 --> 00:33:53.860
Jodi.
朱迪。

794
00:33:54.200 --> 00:33:54.280
Right.
没错。

795
00:33:54.460 --> 00:33:58.780
And a lot of people asked if I would be willing to share my Pam song liSt.
很多人问我是否愿意分享我的“帕姆之歌”列表。

796
00:33:58.940 --> 00:33:59.780
So I'm going to do it today.
所以我今天就要分享了。

797
00:34:00.280 --> 00:34:05.460
Now, just to be clear, sometimes songs make the list because of their lyrics.
现在，先说明一下，有时歌曲入选是因为歌词。

798
00:34:06.040 --> 00:34:08.260
Sometimes it's just the vibe of the music.
有时仅仅是因为音乐的氛围。

799
00:34:09.060 --> 00:34:11.120
Sometimes there's an even more specific reason.
有时则是因为更具体的原因。

800
00:34:11.400 --> 00:34:12.040
So here we go.
那么，我们开始吧。

801
00:34:14.140 --> 00:34:17.020
Next is Phone Call Number 27 by Admiral Twin.
接下来是Admiral Twin的《Phone Call Number 27》。

802
00:34:18.140 --> 00:34:20.600
There's like a phone that rings at the beginning of the song.
这首歌开头好像有个电话铃声。

803
00:34:21.080 --> 00:34:21.460
Oh.
哦。

804
00:34:21.900 --> 00:34:22.780
So it's like, you know.
所以就像是，你懂的。

805
00:34:22.900 --> 00:34:24.420
Because Pam's going to be answering phones.
因为帕姆要接电话了。

806
00:34:24.460 --> 00:34:24.880
That's right.
没错。

807
00:34:25.020 --> 00:34:25.200
Okay.
好的。

808
00:34:25.800 --> 00:34:28.540
The next song is One by Amy Mann.
下一首歌是艾米·曼的《One》。

809
00:34:29.620 --> 00:34:33.740
Then 50 Ways to Leave Your Lover by Paul Simon.
然后是保罗·西蒙的《50 Ways to Leave Your Lover》。

810
00:34:33.900 --> 00:34:35.340
Because she wants to leave Roy.
因为她想离开罗伊。

811
00:34:35.560 --> 00:34:35.840
Maybe.
也许吧。

812
00:34:36.400 --> 00:34:36.920
Maybe.
也许。

813
00:34:38.180 --> 00:34:41.040
Remember this, I made this for between seasons two and three.
记住这一点，这是我在第二季和第三季之间制作的。

814
00:34:41.040 --> 00:34:46.600
So this is after Jim has, you know, confessed his love at casino night.
所以这是在吉姆，你知道的，在赌场之夜表白之后。

815
00:34:46.720 --> 00:34:46.820
Sure, sure.
当然，当然。

816
00:34:46.820 --> 00:34:49.760
And then she's going to come back from the summer.
然后她夏天过后要回来了。

817
00:34:49.900 --> 00:34:51.660
So I was trying to create a vibe for her.
所以我当时在试着为她营造一种氛围。

818
00:34:52.000 --> 00:34:57.120
The next is called Another First Kiss from They Might Be Giants.
下一首叫《Another First Kiss》，来自They Might Be Giants乐队。

819
00:34:57.120 --> 00:34:59.560
Because she knew she already had her first kiss.
因为她知道她已经有过初吻了。

820
00:34:59.720 --> 00:35:01.460
And now she wants another first kiss.
现在她想要另一个初吻。

821
00:35:03.940 --> 00:35:06.480
I'm going to eat off that for a long time.
这个梗我能用好久。

